<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico places all $300 mln dollar puts.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico places all $300 mln dollar puts.</headline>
<text>
<p>MEXICO CITY, Jan 31 (Reuter) Banco de Mexico said in a statement on Friday it had placed all $300 million in dollar put options it had offered at a premium of 16.41 pesos per $1,000.</p>
<p>Several money market traders said they had been expecting the central bank to raise the amount of puts offered to $500 million.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7907))</p>
</text>
